      "message": "so the bottomline is that we need a way to switch between `SkHeifCodec` and `SkAvifCodec` at runtime (essentially so that we can launch this new feature \"behind a flag\" and roll back to the older behavior if there are any issues without reverting everything). this seems to be easiest intermittent solution. once the flag is no longer necessary, this function can be removed.\n\ncan you please point me to where the explicit registration of codecs happen? if it is a possibility, this flag check can be moved there and only one of SkHeifCodec or SkAvifCodec can be registered depending on the flag.",
