      "writtenOn": "2024-09-21T02:49:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here is my understanding of why i made this change:\n\nIt seems like Android does not explicitly register codecs and uses the default behavior where all the codecs are registered and the first codec that returns `true` for a format will be used. So if we return `true` here from `SkAvifCodec` then that image will be decoded using `SkAvifCodec`. And per the current design, we don\u0027t want that behavior, which is why it is dependent on `SkAndroidCodec`.\n\nThis may not be the right way to do it, But i am just explaining what i was trying to do here. :)",
      "parentUuid": "bccbc759_5f4f82eb",
      "revId": "3d0359b0d88e3148fb06d15922f79c7fc4a2c64a",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
